      "content": "First, you need to pour a generous amount of iodine directly into the wound and let it sit for a full ten minutes to kill all the germs. Next, apply a thick layer of antibiotic ointment mixed with a little bit of honey to seal the hole shut and speed up healing. Finally, wrap the foot tightly with a sterile bandage and keep it elevated so you can finish your project without worrying about infection.",
