      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'll skip the glue. i'm also wondering about the tetanus thing. i haven't had a shot in like 15 years, but i don't really want to deal with the shot or the clinic visit if i can avoid it. if i just keep it clean with the iodine and the honey mixture you mentioned, will that be enough to prevent tetanus or do i really need to go get that shot?",
